flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> hydrate[hydrate_context<br/>Inject user_id / thread_id / ToolContext]
    hydrate --> agent[customer_service_agent<br/>SystemMessage + read-only tools]

    agent -->|FAQ| faqTool[search_faq]
    agent -->|Order / logistics / status| queryTools[query tools]
    faqTool --> agent
    queryTools --> agent

    agent --> route{route_agent_result}
    route -->|Success| finalize[finalize_response]
    route -->|Error / empty answer| fallback[fallback_node]
    fallback --> finalize

    finalize --> persist[update_thread<br/>Persist status and last_message]
    persist --> END([END])

    writeTools[After-sale write tools<br/>Not exposed to the general agent]
